From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: denfry <dabinayo@pm.me>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 15:15:36 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] Call teleport and portal events for async teleports

teleportAsync and the async portal logic never called
PlayerTeleportEvent / EntityTeleportEvent, and portals skipped
PlayerPortalEvent / EntityPortalEvent and EntityPortalReadyEvent.
Plugins that guard regions, keep /back history or check teleports
did not see ender pearls, portals, /tp or plugin teleports at all.

The events are now called on the origin region thread before the
entity is detached. Cancelling aborts the teleport and setTo changes
the target, including a different world. For portals the exit portal
is still unknown at that point, so the teleport event carries the
approximate exit; changing it teleports exactly there without a
portal search. The portal event result (target, search and creation
radius, canCreatePortal) drives the async portal search. Callers that
already fired the event or perform internal corrections pass the new
TELEPORT_FLAG_NO_EVENT.

Fixes PaperMC/Folia#490
Fixes PaperMC/Folia#330

